# Rhino's Rampage: "When excess damage is dealt to the creature an opponent controls this way" - not to yours. Grizzly Bears (3
# power with the +1/+0) fights a Serra Angel (4/4): the Angel deals 4 to the 2-toughness Bears (2 excess) and the Bears deal
# only 3 to the Angel (no excess), so there is no reflexive ability: the Sol Ring stays and no target is asked.

